      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Rooms no longer listen for Combiners from before 0.13, so the relay never sees a room's old, easy-to-crack tag. Anyone still on an older Combiner has to update to join.</li><li>When Combiner starts in safe mode, it opens the update window right away, so a fix reaches you without waiting.</li></ul>]]></description>
